        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkauh thu Raguang dailiangmei,",
            "Tingkum khumma jailou lana;",
            "Kamei #!7 jaujian lou khou #!7,",
            "Tan loupui thai guai tei hou the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Tipat lou tho, tipat lou tho,",
            "Neila pui kam tipat lou tho;",
            "Poubaumei Jisu thuan kariu khang Amen.",
            "",
            "2. Khrista guang puanpui tingmik khou,",
            "Neila bammei aniu alau;",
            "Asei nang chang mun gaimei khou,",
            "Nang khou nei khang aniu guange.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaumei jan khou nang timei,",
            "Pai kanei na khuan sini na;",
            "Alau kam neila pui jang #!7,",
            "Tingkauh thu latou dat puange.",
            "",
            "4. Poubaumei Khrista puan pui nung,",
            "Nangta suaihiam lou khang ti o;",
            "Nang tuang tipat mei puat guai na,",
            "Tingsangjang man dat pulak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
